neues Leben zu beginnen. Vor allem Matt fühlt sich anfangs sehr allein in der neuen Umgebung. Doch dann läuft den Turners Lassie, eine Collie-Hündin, zu, die bald zu Matts treuer Begleiterin wird. Als schließlich die Streitereien mit den unliebsamen Nachbarn, denen Turners Schafzucht ein Dorn im Auge ist, eskalieren, beweist Lassie ihre Qualitäten.","poster":"/mz8nOwwuOntjoBuIxNXePLzjZ32.jpg","runtime":94.0,"title":"Lassie","type":"movie","va":6.1,"vc":228,"year":"1994"},"movie:35793":{"cast":[{"id":125459,"name":"Harry Secombe","photo":"/fs5AB7yXSAIx94BMWb9hTy9IztS.jpg"},{"id":29539,"name":"Spike Milligan","photo":"/jnJjdXDPJaGWm7BSsTphqc48EoJ.jpg"},{"id":12446,"name":"Peter Sellers","photo":"/sCVIv2DGoC9U16anTjLwMxKBPZ.jpg"},{"id":548832,"name":"Paddie O'Neil","photo":"/oLGUv6sX4t63kGldG86alJxj8qX.jpg"},{"id":130178,"name":"Alfred Marks","photo":"/ejJUn2aPSQZ8RCb9eEWufq2XBR5.jpg"},{"id":2549223,"name":"Vicky Page","photo":""},{"id":70753,"name":"Bill Kerr","photo":"/aJ7t8clJBKwG50en67Owk36XdAC.jpg"}],"genres":["Komödie"],"id":35793,"original":"Penny Points to Paradise","overview":"","poster":"/b6nNa5QZEcJO98m2ciXtuKJet2Y.jpg","runtime":77.0,"title":"Penny Points to Paradise","type":"movie","va":4.4,"vc":7,"year":"1951"},"movie:36583":{"cast":[{"id":16757,"name":"Sophia Loren","photo":"/lxhkn933v8EuBHvfTWSS5SQQnJ4.jpg"},{"id":1933,"name":"George Peppard","photo":"/td2SN1HGqgGsWLi4YhReMYvH2ik.jpg"},{"id":12726,"name":"Trevor Howard","photo":"/6HDJGXcedqyHx7oCPtUdCXn4z76.jpg"},{"id":11859,"name":"John Mills","photo":"/jMqhI1NeTwgdKsrj9vMshk1r5hP.jpg"},{"id":20510,"name":"Richard Johnson","photo":"/lPnkJLc1yGaf2LMhmlf4OX4hng5.jpg"},{"id":14011,"name":"Tom Courtenay","photo":"/1pEAcscA1GqqZ15ybXF3h9gMss1.jpg"},{"id":55037,"name":"Jeremy Kemp","photo":"/lXKzFH9PM3H0JDlRcgMkw6FWq3i.jpg"},{"id":14371,"name":"Anthony Quayle","photo":"/fiH7Bb3NzerwiFZizveR2BTLVK8.jpg"}],"genres":["Drama","Kriegsfilm","Thriller"],"id":36583,"original":"Operation Crossbow","overview":"Drei au